window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-100-9b7068b25e545999.json"]={sha256:"9b7068b25e545999d1ca4f823214222b07f99c4865fcecfe8f824da8b7dbd287",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-f561a6295e1b6a09","url":"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/34/r1/upd1/final","title":"NIST SP 800-34 Revision 1 contingency planning","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-34 Revision 1 contingency planning","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-100","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-100","related":[{"id":"security-v27-001","referenceUrls":["https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spiffe-specs/spiffe_federation/"],"title":"SPIFFE 聯邦：信任束輪替與傳播餘裕","titleEn":"SPIFFE federation: bundle rotation and propagation margin","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付dataset-batches.json、common-cut.json、invariant-results.csv與service-acceptance.md；每個切點保存兩側來源與校驗，並說明無共同切點時需停止。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver dataset-batches.json, common-cut.json, invariant-results.csv and service-acceptance.md. Preserve both sources and verification for each cut, and explicitly require stopping when no common eligible cut exists.","difference":"畫出簽發端、bundle endpoint、快取及工作負載四個節點；建立舊根、新根、發布時間、簽發切換與舊憑證到期的事件表。信任域、endpoint URL及profile由可信設定綁定，不能讓下載的bundle自證初始信任。","differenceEn":"Draw issuer, bundle endpoint, cache and workload. Build an event table for roots, publication, issuance cutover and final old-certificate expiry. Bind trust domain, endpoint URL and profile through trusted configuration; the downloaded bundle cannot authenticate its own initial trust.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["NIST SP 800-34提供應變復原與驗證規劃；此課共同批次模型是原創簡化設計，並不宣稱任意兩份同時間快照自然具交易一致性。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 事故發生100分鐘；訂單可驗證批次時間70、80、95，庫存70、80、90；同一批次ID在兩邊均通過不變量才可用。 共同批次70、80，最新一致切點80，距事故20分鐘；各自最新95與90不能組成同一共同批次。","新根先傳播再用來簽發；本地保守傳播預算採三次刷新間隔加內部散布延遲。這是教學服務目標，並非規格保證所有客戶端準時刷新。 刷新提示120秒、散布延遲45秒，預計發布後600秒切換簽發；所有時鐘已對齊，未計連續斷線。 可用餘裕600−(3×120+45)=195秒；刷新間隔改180秒時餘裕只剩15秒，不能仍宣稱同樣容錯能力。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["NIST SP 800-34 supports contingency recovery and validation planning. The shared-batch model is an original simplification; it does not claim that arbitrary snapshots with matching timestamps are transactionally consistent. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. The incident occurs at minute 100. Orders has verified batches at 70,80,95; inventory at 70,80,90. A batch is eligible only if the same commit identity passes invariants in both datasets. Common batches are 70 and 80, so the latest consistent cut is 80, twenty minutes before the incident. Independently choosing 95 and 90 does not produce a common committed batch.","Publish a new root before using it to issue identities. The local conservative budget uses three refresh intervals plus internal dissemination delay; this is a teaching service objective, not a guarantee that every client refreshes on time. Use a 120-second refresh hint, 45-second internal dissemination delay and issuance cutover 600 seconds after publication. Clocks are aligned; prolonged disconnection is deliberately outside the nominal model. Margin is 600−(3×120+45)=195 seconds. Increasing refresh to 180 seconds leaves 15 seconds, demonstrating that unchanged cutover time does not preserve the original delay tolerance.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-010","referenceUrls":["https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/configure-pod-container/configure-service-account/"],"title":"Kubernetes 投影 token：輪替、重讀與殘留期限","titleEn":"Kubernetes projected tokens: rotation, rereading and stale lifetimes","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付dataset-batches.json、common-cut.json、invariant-results.csv與service-acceptance.md；每個切點保存兩側來源與校驗，並說明無共同切點時需停止。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver dataset-batches.json, common-cut.json, invariant-results.csv and service-acceptance.md. Preserve both sources and verification for each cut, and explicitly require stopping when no common eligible cut exists.","difference":"以合成t0、expiry、檔案更新與應用重讀事件建立時間線；區分token audience與Pod綁定，不把此練習套用到永久Secret token。","differenceEn":"Build a synthetic timeline of issuance, expiry, file replacement and application rereading. Record audience and Pod binding separately, and do not apply this exercise to long-lived Secret-based tokens.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["NIST SP 800-34提供應變復原與驗證規劃；此課共同批次模型是原創簡化設計，並不宣稱任意兩份同時間快照自然具交易一致性。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 事故發生100分鐘；訂單可驗證批次時間70、80、95，庫存70、80、90；同一批次ID在兩邊均通過不變量才可用。 共同批次70、80，最新一致切點80，距事故20分鐘；各自最新95與90不能組成同一共同批次。","在本課短TTL情境，80%TTL輪替觸發早於24小時條件；以到期減觸發與重讀延遲估算餘裕。觸發時刻不是保證完成時刻。 TTL為3600秒，假設輪替即刻成功，程序120秒後重讀；改變情境把重讀延遲增為480秒，其他條件不變。 觸發t=2880秒，基準餘裕3600−2880−120=600秒；延遲後3600−2880−480=240秒。網路重試需另外扣除。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["NIST SP 800-34 supports contingency recovery and validation planning. The shared-batch model is an original simplification; it does not claim that arbitrary snapshots with matching timestamps are transactionally consistent. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. The incident occurs at minute 100. Orders has verified batches at 70,80,95; inventory at 70,80,90. A batch is eligible only if the same commit identity passes invariants in both datasets. Common batches are 70 and 80, so the latest consistent cut is 80, twenty minutes before the incident. Independently choosing 95 and 90 does not produce a common committed batch.","For the short TTL used here, the 80%-of-TTL trigger precedes the 24-hour condition. Estimate margin by subtracting trigger time and reread delay from expiry; a trigger is not a guarantee of completed renewal. Use a 3600-second TTL, assume immediate successful renewal at the trigger, and reread 120 seconds later. The changed fixture increases reread delay to 480 seconds with other conditions unchanged. Trigger time is 2880 seconds; margin is 3600−2880−120=600 seconds, falling to 240 with delayed rereading. Network retries would require an additional, separately stated deduction.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-5d270ea0cb6e60ce","url":"https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spiffe-specs/spiffe_federation/","title":"SPIFFE Federation specification","titleEn":"SPIFFE Federation specification","publisher":"SPIFFE","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-a6b522d38bd97a16","url":"https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/configure-pod-container/configure-service-account/","title":"Configure Service Accounts for Pods","titleEn":"Configure Service Accounts for Pods","publisher":"Kubernetes","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
